# Strata SDK: Strata Attributes

Reference for the `strata_attribute` DSL and all available attribute types. Applies to any ActiveRecord model that includes `Strata::Attributes`.

## DSL Overview

```ruby
class MyModel < ApplicationRecord
  include Strata::Attributes

  strata_attribute :field_name, :type              # basic type
  strata_attribute :field_name, :type, array: true # array of typed values (jsonb)
  strata_attribute :field_name, :type, range: true # range (generates _start + _end columns)
end
```

**Important:** `:array` as a type (`:array`) and `array: true` as an option are distinct mechanisms — both produce a `jsonb` column but have different semantics. See `strata-attributes/array.md` for details.

## Column Mapping by Type

| Attribute Type | Database Column(s) | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `name` | `{attr}_first:string`, `{attr}_middle:string`, `{attr}_last:string`, `{attr}_suffix:string` | 4 columns |
| `address` | `{attr}_street_line_1:string`, `{attr}_street_line_2:string`, `{attr}_city:string`, `{attr}_state:string`, `{attr}_zip_code:string` | 5 columns |
| `memorable_date` | `{attr}:date` | 1 column (year/month/day fields stored as date) |
| `money` | `{attr}:integer` | Stores cents |
| `tax_id` | `{attr}:string` | 1 column |
| `array` (type) | `{attr}:jsonb` | Array of hashes |
| `us_date` | `{attr}:date` | 1 column |
| `year_month` | `{attr}:string` | Single string column |
| `year_quarter` | `{attr}:string` | Single string column |
| `array: true` (option) | `{attr}:jsonb` | Array of the base type |
| `range: true` (option) | `{attr}_start:{type}`, `{attr}_end:{type}` | 2 columns |

